@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Fitbit API → AI API → Firebase (Using Coding ID)

actor User

participant "CodingID" as CID
participant "App" as APP
participant "Fitbit API" as FITBIT
participant "AI API" as AI
participant "Firebase Database" as FIREBASE

' ======================
' SEQUENCE FLOW
' ======================

User -> APP: Start Sync Process

APP -> CID: Request Coding ID
CID --> APP: Return codingID

APP -> FITBIT: Request heart rate and steps
FITBIT --> APP: Send Fitbit data (HR, steps)

APP -> AI: Send data + codingID\nfor analysis or recommendation
AI --> APP: Return AI insights/results

APP -> FIREBASE: Save Fitbit + AI data\nunder codingID
FIREBASE --> APP: Confirm save

APP -> User: Show success message

@enduml
